      "taskQuestion": "Can these measures reduce risk without guaranteeing that phishing will stop?",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Marcus:</b> Yes. Reduced exposure and correctly configured email authentication can lower risk, alongside training, filtering, secure access, and reporting."
